  bodyText: "Just days before she was set to walk down the aisle in New Manila\u2019s
    wedding of the season, high-society heiress Allison Milton has abruptly called
    off her engagement to wealthy fianc\xE9 Lon Hammond, and was spotted hours later
    passionately reuniting with her estranged ex-boyfriend Noah outside his restored
    white-columned estate. "
